{
  "snapshot": "- banner:\n  - heading [level=1]: Dairy 360\n  - generic: harness · in memory\n  - button: Recording as geist-synthetic · Direct entry\n  - button: Menu · Herd\n  - button: Search ⌘K\n  - button: dark\n  - button: Assistant\n- navigation:\n  - link:\n    - /url: /animals\n    - text: Animals\n  - link:\n    - /url: /animals/calvings\n    - text: Calvings\n  - link:\n    - /url: /animals/health\n    - text: Health\n- main:\n  - heading [level=2]: Record a calving\n  - paragraph: Enter calvings oldest first. Each one creates its calf, so in order means a farm-born animal exists before anything refers to it.\n  - text: Dam\n  - generic: Find dam by serial or name\n  - searchbox: Noori\n  - paragraph: Search narrows the list. Ineligible dams remain visible with their reason.\n  - combobox\n  - generic: When did she calve?\n  - generic: Date\n  - textbox:\n    - /placeholder: 2019, Mar 2019, or 6 Jul 2023\n    - text: 06/07/2023\n  - checkbox [disabled]\n  - generic: Even the year is a guess — only applies to a bare year, since an estimate is stored as January 1\n  - paragraph: Ambiguous — 06/07/2023 could be June or July, and guessing wrong produces a date nothing can detect as wrong. Type the month as a word (6 Jul 2023) or use 2023-07-06.\n  - generic: Calf sex\n  - radiogroup:\n    - radio:\n      - generic: \"1\"\n      - generic: female\n    - radio:\n      - generic: \"2\"\n      - generic: male\n  - generic: Outcome\n  - radiogroup:\n    - radio [checked]:\n      - generic: \"1\"\n      - generic: Live\n    - radio:\n      - generic: \"2\"\n      - generic: Stillborn\n    - radio:\n      - generic: \"3\"\n      - generic: Died within 24h\n  - paragraph: A calf that did not live is still recorded as an animal, still opens the lactation, and still counts toward parity and the calving interval.\n  - generic: Which calf is this?\n  - paragraph: \"Choose the dam, the calving date and the calf's sex first — which animals can be linked depends on all three: an animal's birth cannot postdate its own history, and one recorded as the other sex is not this calf.\"\n  - generic: Sire reference (optional)\n  - combobox\n  - generic: Free text. A stable identifier, not a display name.\n  - generic: Observed by (optional)\n  - combobox\n  - generic: Who actually saw it. Leave blank unless someone did — nobody observed a purchase record. A stable identifier, not a display name.\n  - button [disabled]: Record calving\n  - generic: The calving date is not understood yet — finish it or clear it.\n  - paragraph: Cmd/Ctrl+Enter saves from a field when the record is ready.\n- dialog \"Discard unsaved changes?\":\n  - heading \"Discard unsaved changes?\" [level=2]\n  - paragraph: \"Calving: your changes have not been saved. Discarding removes these changes.\"\n  - paragraph: Leaving discards this draft. Keep editing to retain your entries.\n  - button \"Keep editing\" [active]\n  - button \"Discard changes\"",
